{"hymn":"S687","parent":"E1232","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Muertos en pecados tú y yo","subtitle":"La iglesia—Como un solo y nuevo hombre","syl":{"n1":["Muer","i"],"n2":["tos","t"],"n3":"en","n4":["pe","i"],"n5":["ca","m"],"n6":["dos","t"],"n7":"tú‿y","n8":"yo,","n9":"En","n10":"el","n11":["mun","i"],"n12":["do","t"],"n13":["lle","i"],"n14":["no","t"],"n15":"de","n16":["mal","i"],"n17":["dad;","t"],"n18":["Pe","i"],"n19":["ro‿en","t"],"n20":["Cris","i"],"n21":["to,","t"],"n22":"Dios","n23":"nos","n24":["a","i"],"n25":["vi","m"],"n26":["vó,","t"],"n27":"Y‿en","n28":["lu","i"],"n29":["ga","m"],"n30":["res","t"],"n31":["ce","i"],"n32":["les","m"],"n33":["tia","m"],"n34":["les","t"],"n35":"nos","n36":["sen","i"],"n37":["tó.","t"],"n39":["Cris","i"],"n40":["to","t"],"n41":["u","i"],"n42":["ne","t"],"n43":"a","n44":"los","n45":["her","i"],"n46":["ma","m"],"n47":["nos,","t"],"n49":["Vé","i"],"n50":["an","m"],"n51":["los","t"],"n52":["u","i"],"n53":["no","t"],"n54":"en","n55":"el","n56":["Se","i"],"n57":["ñor.","t"],"n59":["Su‿a","i"],"n60":["mor","t"],"n61":"nos","n62":["en","i"],"n63":["tre","m"],"n64":["te","m"],"n65":["je","t"],"n66":["jun","i"],"n67":["tos","t"],"n68":"A","n69":"la","n70":["es","i"],"n71":["ta","m"],"n72":["tu","m"],"n73":["ra","t"],"n74":"de","n75":"Su","n76":["ple","i"],"n77":["ni","m"],"n78":["tud.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Con los santos hay que comprender","Toda la gran dimensión de Dios;","Conociendo a Cristo y Su amor,","Nos llenamos a la plenitud de Dios."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Dios Su plan nos dio a conocer,","El misterio es visible ya;","Cristo con la iglesia uno es","Para avergonzar la astucia de Satán."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Al Dios Padre es nuestra oración:","Fortalece nuestro hombre interior,","Haz Tu hogar en nuestro corazón;","Por Tu plan arráiganos en Tu amor."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["Cada miembro debe proveer","Cristo para el Cuerpo concertar;","Por la actividad de cada cual,","En amor Su Cuerpo edificará."]},{"label":"6.","lines":["Cumpliremos el deseo de Dios,","Como el nuevo hombre de Su plan;","En la iglesia gloria sea a Él,","Y en Jesucristo para siempre, amén."]}]}